{"articleNo":"83131","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=83131&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"전국대학생 창업동아리 연합조직(NEST) 발대식 참가자 모집(-5.20)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.05.14","hit":"3356","attachments":[{"name":"NEST 발대식 개최안.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=83131&attachNo=71581"},{"name":"참석자 명단.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=83131&attachNo=71659"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong><font color=\"#000000\">전국 대학생 창업동아리 연합조직(NEST) </font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; NEST 발대식&nbsp; 참가자 모집</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">- 행사개요 : 창업동아리 중심의 대학생 창업문화 확산</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">- 개최일시 : </font><font color=\"#0900ff\">2013년 5월 24일(금) 14:00- 16:00</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">- 개최장소 : 여의도 중소기업중앙회 그랜드볼룸(B1)</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">- 참석대상 : 중소기업청,창업진흥원, 지역창업 네트워크</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 대학생 창업아카데미, 창업선도대학 관계자</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 창업동아리 등 500여명</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">- 행사표제 : NEST더불어 꿈꾸며, 글로벌을 향해</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">- 참가대상&nbsp;</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">-&nbsp;2012년 대학창업교육 패키지 지원사업 참여 동아리</span></font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2013년 대학생 창업아카데미 지원사업&nbsp; 창업동아리 참여 희망자</span></font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></font></strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (*2013년 대학생 창업아카데미 지원사업 창업동아리 모집은 5월 16일(목)공고예정)</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">- 차량이용&nbsp; : 행사당일 5월 24일(금) 09:00 동대구 역 출발&nbsp;</span></font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">- 기타사항&nbsp; : </span></font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;1. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">참가를 희망하는 학생은 첨부파일에 있는 명단을 작성하여</span></span></font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#ff007f\">5월 20(월) 09:00까지&nbsp;이메일(<a href=\"mailto:wndbs75@kumoh.ac.kr\">wndbs75@kumoh.ac.kr</a>)제출 요망.</font></span></font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2.&nbsp;</span></font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">창업진흥센터 이오스관 313호 054-478-6944 묻의&nbsp;</span></font></strong></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></font></